Z||000000||OcalaFiero||08-31-2001||10:18 AM||||Well, after about a month or so of repairs, replacements, a nasty backfire that blew off exhaust parts and threatening to part out my '86 coupe, I got her running last night. I had to replace the converter with a test pipe, (strictly for off road use only of course) but I got it all bolted back together and she runs like a champ. I have on minor exhaust leak to attend to, as the car sounds like a redneck's wet dream, but after that I'm gonna take her out and clean her up and the I'll post some pics. (I didn't want to post pics of the car on jackstands, kind of sad really).  ||||reg||1
